# The GreenMail release the smoke test runs (tools/greenmail-smoke.sh).
# Kept apart from the script so CI's cache of the jar is keyed on this pin
# alone, and a change to the script does not download the jar again.
# To move to a newer GreenMail: change both, taking the SHA-256 from Maven
# Central's `.sha256` beside the jar and checking it against the downloaded
# file.
